  "details": "When opening the VRChat SDK panel and navigating to the Builder tab, the VRC Per Platform Override component is automatically added to the root object of the avatar, even though I haven't done anything.\n\nIs this intended behavior?\n\nI have previously uploaded avatars using multi-platform settings (Android, iOS), but not with this avatar. So I suspect this automatic addition might be unintended.",
